p('<b>Executive recommendation</b>','H');p('Replace the manual teacher form → Ops verification → booking request handoffs with an event-driven renewal orchestration layer. Verify gateway settlement and canonical student/batch data deterministically; fast-track only clean same-batch renewals; route every discrepancy to a named owner with an SLA; and keep actual schedule creation idempotent and capacity-aware. AI should draft communications, not decide payment validity, identity or child placement.')
