p('<b>Where the pipeline leaks</b>','Body2')
bullets(['Invoices → faculty form: teacher delay, wrong invoice ID/link, duplicate submissions after browser errors, form contact not matching payer, and renewals with no form.','Faculty form → booking request: manual Ops queue, repeated payment checks, amount/discount confusion (gross amount vs net amount), incorrect student/course/educator IDs, weekend/after-hours gaps and unclear ownership.','Booking request → schedule: same-batch requests still wait for allocation; batch is full; parent requests a different batch; schedule availability/IDs are missing; a request can remain pending after payment.','Cross-table risks: duplicate booking requests, stale current-batch references, soft-deleted records, partial/failed payment mistaken for paid, masked PII that cannot safely support fuzzy matching, and schedule rows that represent only some purchased sessions.'])
