bullets(['84904: form mobile differs from invoice mobile → PARENT_CONTACT_MISMATCH; human guardian verification, not fuzzy matching.','84905: same batch is at 6/6 capacity and request 5505 is Failed_Batch_Full → capacity exception and scheduling escalation.','84908: two faculty forms (3308/3309) for one invoice → duplicate form; process one canonical record.','84909 / 84911: Partially_Paid / Failed → no approval until gateway confirms full settlement.','84912: continue_same_batch=No and request 5512 awaits parent selection → batch-change workflow.','Form 3313 points to invoice 84931, while invoice 84913 exists → invoice not found plus a paid invoice without a matched form.','84906, 84910, 84913: paid renewal invoices have no matched faculty form → teacher reminder and escalation.'])
