p('<b>Target architecture</b>','Body2');p('Payment gateway webhook → n8n event intake → canonical invoice/student/batch lookup → deterministic rules engine → (a) same-batch, fully paid, capacity-safe: create booking request idempotently and trigger schedule allocator; (b) exception: create case with reason code, owner, age timer and message draft → human resolution → re-run validation → booking. A daily reconciliation sweep catches missed webhooks and orphaned records.')
bullets(['Remove the teacher renewal form for the happy path: payment metadata already identifies student, course and teacher; use the authenticated student record and renewal intent captured at checkout. Retain a teacher correction form only for missing/changed data.','Eliminate manual Ops payment verification by querying the gateway API and validating captured/settled state, currency, invoice ID and net amount. Never trust a screenshot or client-side form as payment proof.','For same-batch renewal, reuse canonical batch ID and schedule template only when capacity and schedule policy pass. Use a unique idempotency key (invoice_id + renewal_term) to prevent duplicate requests.','Use an LLM only to classify free-text remarks into a suggested queue and draft messages. Structured rule outcomes remain authoritative; low-confidence or conflicting data always goes to a human.'])
p('<b>Exception routing matrix</b>','Body2')
