p('The repository includes a runnable Python reconciliation engine and an importable n8n workflow. The n8n workflow accepts five JSON arrays by webhook, runs deterministic checks in a Code node and returns auto-approval-ready rows, exceptions, message drafts and booking backlog. The local script reads the five CSVs and writes matching result files.')
bullets(['Prototype result: 3 auto-approval-ready rows (84903, 84907, 84908); 12 exceptions; 3 open booking requests. The 84908 duplicate form is separately flagged and is not a second approval.','Discount logic compares faculty amount_paid to invoice net_amount, not gross amount. Thus 84907 correctly reconciles ₹7,600 after ₹1,900 discount against ₹7,600 paid.','No schedule writes or WhatsApp sends are enabled. Before production, add authenticated gateway lookup, DB transaction, unique constraints, retry/dead-letter queue, secrets management, audit log and approval gates.'])
