p('<b>Daily Ops Head dashboard</b>','Body2');bullets(['Top cards: paid renewals today; auto-approved; stuck invoices >12h; forms awaiting validation; booking requests awaiting allocation; first-class scheduled; exception backlog; hours saved (measured against baseline).','Funnel: paid → form/intent captured → verified → booking request → batch allocated → schedule rows created → first class attended. Show counts and conversion at each transition.','Exception table: invoice/student masked ID, reason code, owner, created age, next action, SLA breach indicator, last parent/teacher contact. Filters by region/timezone, course, teacher, payment gateway and renewal date.','Capacity panel: batch occupancy, available seats, failed allocations, alternative slots offered and accepted.'])
